# .env.example — the canonical, comment-documented list of every runtime variable.
# Rules: docs/configuration.md. Update this file in the SAME change that adds or
# removes a config key; each app validates its variables at startup and fails fast.
#
# TEMPLATE-TODO: replace this stub with the project's real variables once the
# toolchain is chosen (an adopted stack pack's appendices name the concrete keys).
#
# Example shape:
# DATABASE_URL=            # backend — Postgres connection string (local dev)
# SESSION_SECRET=          # backend — cookie signing secret; generate per environment
# SMS_ENABLED=false        # backend — default-off integration flag; no-op sink when false
